WEBVTT

00:07:28.851 --> 00:07:30.263
[La fuite semble impossible]

00:07:30.287 --> 00:07:35.715
Les mots seuls peuvent-ils
résister à la violence ?

00:07:38.038 --> 00:07:43.109
Oh, non, oh.

00:07:43.133 --> 00:07:44.368
[Brulé vif]

00:07:44.392 --> 00:07:45.727
[Sam Hose est lynché]

00:07:45.751 --> 00:07:50.656
Oh, non, oh

00:07:50.680 --> 00:07:52.613
[Son corps coupé en morceaux]

00:07:53.426 --> 00:07:55.900
Oh, non, oh.

00:07:55.900 --> 00:07:57.855
[Réduit en cendres]

00:07:57.855 --> 00:08:00.085
[Des Tranches De Foie Cuit A 10 Centimes.]